message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "samber/ro: Streams & Reactive Programming paradigm for Go"
abstract: >-
  A Go implementation of the ReactiveX specification. ro offers a declarative
  and composable API — Observables, Observers and 200+ operators — to build
  event-driven and asynchronous applications on top of infinite data streams.
type: software
